SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Amorgos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Chora's own feast\, held by the Simonidis association in the Loza square on 5-6 August: after the liturgy the village serves food and wine with live island music and dancing under the plane trees. Smaller than Agia Paraskevi but right in the middle of the prettiest village on the island.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#chora-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chora
